title: "Claims Validity of Software Engineering Folklore"
abstract: >-
  Tooling for a master's thesis examining which claims made in practitioner
  software engineering books are supported by empirical evidence and believed
  by practitioners. Supervised by Davide Fucci (Blekinge Institute of
  Technology) and Greg Wilson (Third Bit).
